WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:14.812
The Carters were on a trip.

2
00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:18.599
They were looking for their hotel.

3
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.584
Harry checked his map.

4
00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:27.632
"We should turn left now," he said.

5
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:31.807
"We don't need the map, Harry," said Mom.

6
00:00:31.808 --> 00:00:35.896
"My phone has a GPS.

7
00:00:35.897 --> 00:00:43.792
It will take us to our hotel."

8
00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:46.983
Harry sighed.

9
00:00:46.984 --> 00:00:55.665
He liked maps better than phones.

10
00:00:55.666 --> 00:01:02.772
The family checked into the hotel.

11
00:01:02.773 --> 00:01:06.427
"Time for sightseeing!" Dad said.

12
00:01:06.428 --> 00:01:10.775
"I can find the museum on my map," Harry said.

13
00:01:10.776 --> 00:01:20.657
"I'll use my phone," Mom said.

14
00:01:20.658 --> 00:01:26.166
Next they looked for the zoo.

15
00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:29.547
"I have my map," Harry said.

16
00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:40.110
"Maps take too long," Oliver said.

17
00:01:40.111 --> 00:01:43.494
After the zoo they went to a park.

18
00:01:43.495 --> 00:01:50.165
Everyone rested on a bench.

19
00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:54.083
Soon Mom turned on her phone again.

20
00:01:54.084 --> 00:02:01.450
"Let's go back to the hotel," she said.

21
00:02:01.451 --> 00:02:06.913
"Turn right," Mom said.

22
00:02:06.914 --> 00:02:13.021
"Now straight. And then . . ."

23
00:02:13.022 --> 00:02:16.611
Suddenly Mom's phone went dark.

24
00:02:16.612 --> 00:02:20.901
"Oh no!" Mom cried.

25
00:02:20.902 --> 00:02:25.924
"The battery is dead!" Dad said.

26
00:02:25.925 --> 00:02:30.176
"Where's our hotel?" Emmy asked.

27
00:02:30.177 --> 00:02:34.720
"I don't know," Dad said.

28
00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:44.301
"We're lost!" cried Oliver.

29
00:02:44.302 --> 00:02:48.416
Harry opened his map.

30
00:02:48.417 --> 00:02:52.872
"We have to walk along this street," he said.

31
00:02:52.873 --> 00:03:01.052
"Then we turn left two times."

32
00:03:01.053 --> 00:03:06.364
The family arrived back at the hotel.

33
00:03:06.365 --> 00:03:10.967
"I'm glad you brought a map, Harry!" said Mom.

34
00:03:10.968 --> 00:03:19.739
"Me too!" said Harry.
